    "comment_grip": "G1 Omnipicker：finger_close_ratio 0.75（pinch 阈值约 50.5mm）；lock_radius_m 0.05m（指尖中点球内锁粒）。经 xpbd_process → DG_FINGER_CLOSE_RATIO / lock_radius"
